1.2. "Authorised Representative" shall mean:
(a) For the Society: The Honorary Secretary or any other office bearer of the Managing Committee duly authorised by a resolution of the Managing Committee.
(b) For the Contractor: The Proprietor or any person duly authorised in writing by the Proprietor.

1.3. "Premises" shall mean the entire property of the Society comprising of:
(a) Two residential towers, namely Tower A (G+18 floors) and Tower B (G+14 floors);
(b) Basement parking levels B1 and B2;
(c) Clubhouse, including swimming pool area, gymnasium, and multipurpose hall;
(d) Landscaped gardens, podium level, and all common areas;
(e) All service areas including pump rooms, electrical rooms, garbage chute rooms, and staircase areas.

1.4. "Services" shall mean the cleaning and housekeeping services as more particularly described in Annexure A hereto.

1.5. "Contract Period" shall mean the period commencing from 1st February, 2024 and ending on 31st January, 2025, unless terminated earlier in accordance with the provisions of this Agreement.

1.6. "Contract Price" shall mean the monthly consideration payable by the Society to the Contractor as set out in Clause 4 herein.

**2. SCOPE OF WORK**

